title: Hedgerows
text: Three fields and two hedges. Don't disturb the cow in the middle field on your first trip.
trick: one teleporter pair jumps both hedges at once, clearing the middle field; a second pair drops into it
motif: three fields side by side, split by two hedgerows
ink: 4
expect: depth>=6
